{
  "method": "post",
  "path": "/api/chapter-revisions/{chapter_revision_id}/script-generations",
  "operation": {
    "summary": "异步生成章节脚本",
    "deprecated": false,
    "description": "异步生成接口。调用后只创建任务，不直接返回生成内容。\n\n前端处理方式：\n- 提交请求后读取返回的 `task_id`\n- 使用 `GET /api/tasks/{task_id}` 查询任务状态\n- 或使用 `/api/tasks/{task_id}/events` 监听 SSE 事件\n\n幂等要求：\n- 请求必须带 `Idempotency-Key`\n- 一次用户操作生成一个稳定 key\n- 用户重复点击或网络重试时复用同一个 key，避免重复扣费和重复创建任务\n\n生成内容：\n- 把章节正文转换为章节脚本 revision\n- 脚本包含段落、场景、角色说话信息和资源槽位\n- 后续资源绑定和 VNGraph 编译都依赖这个脚本\n\n前端填写：\n- `instructions`：本次脚本生成的补充要求，自由文本\n- `parameters`：没有明确控件时传 `{}`\n\n后续步骤：\n- 任务完成后不会自动切换当前脚本版本\n- 审核通过后调用 `PUT /api/chapter-revisions/{chapter_revision_id}/script-head`",
    "operationId": "generate_chapter_script_api_projects__project_id__chapters__chapter_index__chapter_scripts_generations_post",
    "tags": [
      "创作版本与生成/视觉小说图步骤一：章节脚本与资源槽",
      "章节脚本与资源槽"
    ],
    "parameters": [
      {
        "in": "path",
        "name": "chapter_revision_id",
        "required": true,
        "schema": {
          "title": "Chapter Revision Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "description": "章节正文修订编号。"
      },
      {
        "in": "header",
        "name": "Idempotency-Key",
        "required": true,
        "schema": {
          "maxLength": 255,
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Idempotency-Key",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "description": "幂等键。一次用户操作生成一个稳定字符串；同一用户用同一个 key 重试同一请求会返回同一任务，换请求内容会返回冲突。"
      }
    ],
    "requestBody": {
      "content": {
        "application/json": {
          "schema": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/GenerationRequest"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Body"
          },
          "example": {
            "parameters": {},
            "instructions": "接口文档验证用，按短章节生成脚本。"
          }
        }
      },
      "required": true,
      "description": "章节脚本生成请求。没有额外要求时传 {} 或 null。"
    },
    "responses": {
      "202": {
        "description": "任务已接受",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TaskAccepted"
            },
            "example": {
              "task_id": "062435a2-74d5-4687-bfc5-fe0018b1dfee",
              "status": "queued",
              "events_url": "/api/tasks/062435a2-74d5-4687-bfc5-fe0018b1dfee/events",
              "created": true
            }
          }
        },
        "headers": {},
        "x-apifox-name": "成功",
        "x-apifox-ordering": 0
      },
      "422": {
        "description": "请求参数校验失败",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
            }
          }
        },
        "headers": {},
        "x-apifox-name": "参数错误",
        "x-apifox-ordering": 1
      }
    },
    "security": [
      {
        "cookieAuth": []
      }
    ],
    "x-apifox-folder": "创作版本与生成/视觉小说图步骤一：章节脚本与资源槽",
    "x-apifox-status": "released",
    "x-run-in-apifox": "https://app.apifox.com/web/project/8663103/apis/api-495923818-run"
  }
}
